### Try the API from VS Code (REST Client) or JetBrains Rider / Visual Studio.
@base = http://localhost:5077

### List configured workflows
GET {{base}}/api/workflows
X-Api-Key: demo-ada-requester

### Ada submits an expense (₦750,000: Line Manager -> Finance)
# @name submit
POST {{base}}/api/requests/
X-Api-Key: demo-ada-requester
Content-Type: application/json

{ "workflow": "expense", "title": "Team offsite venue", "amount": 750000, "currency": "NGN" }

### Bayo (manager) sees what is waiting for him
GET {{base}}/api/requests/?awaitingMe=true
X-Api-Key: demo-bayo-manager

### Bayo approves
POST {{base}}/api/requests/{{submit.response.body.id}}/approve
X-Api-Key: demo-bayo-manager
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comment": "Within budget" }

### Chidi (finance) approves - request completes
POST {{base}}/api/requests/{{submit.response.body.id}}/approve
X-Api-Key: demo-chidi-finance
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Full audit trail
GET {{base}}/api/requests/{{submit.response.body.id}}/audit
X-Api-Key: demo-ada-requester
